# Windows Instance Configuration

## 1. Instance settings

Platform: Microsoft Windows
Operating system: Windows Server
Instance name: windows-server-lab

## 2. Network settings

Protocol: TCP
Port: 3389
Service: Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP)

## 3. Security settings

- Allow RDP only from trusted IP addresses.
- Do not expose remote access to everyone.
- Keep administrator credentials private.

## 4. Connection procedure

1. Open the Lightsail console.
2. Select the Windows instance.
3. Open the Connect section.
4. Select Connect using RDP.
5. Verify that the Windows desktop appears.

## 5. Verification

Expected instance state: Running
Expected result: Windows desktop accessible through RDP

Note: These are example settings, not live server configuration.
